WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.093 --> 00:00:05.083
Ringo held a small wing.

2
00:00:05.084 --> 00:00:08.178
He put a drop of glue on it.

3
00:00:08.179 --> 00:00:12.827
"Your model spaceship looks good," Bot said.

4
00:00:12.828 --> 00:00:18.550
"Thanks!" Ringo grinned. "It's almost—"

5
00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:24.012
Stomp! Stomp! A small boy ran into Ringo's room.

6
00:00:24.013 --> 00:00:26.873
"Ahh!" Ringo jumped.

7
00:00:26.874 --> 00:00:31.427
"Space Patrol is so cool!" the boy shouted.

8
00:00:31.428 --> 00:00:36.127
Then he ran back out.

9
00:00:36.128 --> 00:00:40.850
"Oops," Bot said. "You dropped the wing."

10
00:00:40.851 --> 00:00:48.111
Ringo groaned. "That kid scared me.

11
00:00:48.112 --> 00:00:53.938
Now the wing is stuck to the floor!"

12
00:00:53.939 --> 00:00:58.145
More kids stomped down the hallway.

13
00:00:58.146 --> 00:01:01.824
"Who are those kids?" Ringo asked.

14
00:01:01.825 --> 00:01:05.940
"It's Take Your Child to Work Day," Bot said.

15
00:01:05.941 --> 00:01:13.114
"So some workers brought their kids."

16
00:01:13.115 --> 00:01:17.195
"The kids are really noisy," Ringo said.

17
00:01:17.196 --> 00:01:20.741
"I want to finish this model."

18
00:01:20.742 --> 00:01:24.238
The kids ran by again.

19
00:01:24.239 --> 00:01:26.947
Ringo stepped into the hallway.

20
00:01:26.948 --> 00:01:31.131
"Um, can you please be quiet?"

21
00:01:31.132 --> 00:01:34.002
The kids didn't hear Ringo.

22
00:01:34.003 --> 00:01:38.926
Lucy looked out of her room. "Be quiet!"

23
00:01:38.927 --> 00:01:41.639
The kids ignored her too.

24
00:01:41.640 --> 00:01:46.398
Ringo's phone beeped.

25
00:01:46.399 --> 00:01:49.578
It was a message from Captain Nova.

26
00:01:49.579 --> 00:01:53.555
"Ringo! I have a mission for you!"

27
00:01:53.556 --> 00:01:57.757
"Good!" Ringo smiled.

28
00:01:57.758 --> 00:02:03.892
"I can get away from all these kids!"

